ulator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 54% of normal in January to February and 58% in August to September 2025. Grid 28384 had its driest year in 1960, at 69% of normal.</p>"}
